---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import {getCollection,render} from 'astro:content';
export async function getStaticPaths(){return (await getCollection('projects')).map(entry=>({params:{id:entry.id},props:{entry}}));}
const {entry}=Astro.props;const {Content}=await render(entry);
---
<Base title={entry.data.title+' — Solvinter'}><article class="project"><p class="eyebrow">Projects / Presentation in development</p><h1>{entry.data.title}</h1>{entry.id==='observatory'?<><p>Solvinter Observatory is a planned project for identifying opportunities by combining open data, AI and economic analysis. The observatory is open to a range of applications.</p><h3>Compute Economics</h3><p>The first planned application is Compute Economics: tracking GPU prices, mining revenue and rental markets to identify differences in profitability.</p><p>The project is at the idea stage. Data collection and ongoing monitoring are not yet operational.</p></>:<><p>{{eira:'AI, education and human agency.',metabolismx:'Medicine, metabolism and biotechnology development.','clinical-ai':'A service for evaluating medical AI systems is in development.'}[entry.id]}</p><p>Project presentation in development. Status and work samples need review before publication.</p></>}<a href="/en/#projects">← All projects</a></article></Base>
